# What the "0G setup" workflow does on its next run, one per line:
#   key      generate Ordo's 0G key in the job (kept in Vercel, never printed); the log shows its address to fund
#   inft     deploy OrdoAgentNFT (agents as ERC-7857 iNFTs)  → ZG_INFT_ADDRESS
#   storage  copy validation evidence to 0G Storage          → EVIDENCE_STORE=0g
#   ledger   fund the 0G Compute ledger (3 0G minimum)       → then set LLM_PROVIDER=0g by hand
# Done: key 0xa902C5542Fc209e639Ed151a3619e103D18bD55a, OrdoAgentNFT 0x9577498d6305a8498744ab33217fab6722ff8141,
# EVIDENCE_STORE=0g (run 3). Kept empty so merges do not deploy again.
